                  "text": "3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E yedi ang’wen ma kwone, ma bombgi abusiel abusiel kubang’gi nzu, wang’gi romo kumgi ceke ku yor i ie de: man kayom umbe igi dieceng’ ku diewor, ma giwacu ko kumae,",
          "type": "text",
